6. Create Python virtual environment.
7. Document project requirements.

## Initial setup

```bash
mkdir -p ~/sentinellite
cd ~/sentinellite

python3 -m venv venv
source venv/bin/activate
```

Initialize Git:

```bash
git init
```

Create `.gitignore`:

```text
venv/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.env
data/*.db
data/*.jsonl
```

## Deliverables

