# 9. Phase 4 — SIEM Detection Engine

## Objective

Detect suspicious behavior from normalized events.

This is the main SIEM intelligence layer.

## Tools

* Python
* SQLite
* YAML/JSON
* Pytest

## Detection architecture

```text
Normalized Events
       ↓
Detection Engine
       ↓
Rules
       ↓
Correlation
       ↓
Alert
```

## Initial rules

### AUTH-001 — SSH brute force

```text
5+ failed login attempts
from same IP
within 60 seconds
```

Generate:

```text
Severity: HIGH
```

### AUTH-002 — Suspicious successful login

```text
Multiple failed logins
       +
Successful login
       ↓
Suspicious authentication
```

### AUTH-003 — Privilege escalation

Detect suspicious privilege escalation activity.

### NET-001 — Excessive connection attempts

Detect unusually high connection activity.

## Rule structure

```yaml
id: AUTH-001

name: SSH Brute Force

event_type: failed_login

threshold: 5

time_window: 60

severity: HIGH
```

## Deliverables

* Detection engine
* Rule engine
* Rule configuration
* Severity calculation
* Detection tests

---

