Turn SIEM detections into manageable security incidents.

## Tools

* Python
* SQLite
* Flask API

## Alert lifecycle

```text
NEW
 ↓
INVESTIGATING
 ↓
 ├── FALSE_POSITIVE
 │
 └── RESOLVED
```

## Alert fields

```text
alert_id
rule_id
title
description
severity
source_ip
status
created_at
updated_at
```

## Incident fields

```text
incident_id
title
severity
status
assigned_to
created_at
resolved_at
```

## Features

* Alert creation
* Alert filtering
* Incident creation
* Status changes
* Investigation notes
* Alert-to-incident correlation

