# 24. Development Rule

We will follow one important rule throughout the project:

> **Do not add a technology merely to put it on the resume. Implement it and use it in the project.**

For example, if Docker is listed, the application will actually run in Docker.

If CI/CD is listed, the repository will actually have an automated pipeline.

If AWS is listed, the application will actually be deployed to an AWS environment.

This keeps the project technically credible and gives you something concrete to explain during interviews.

